      "text": "Rio de Janeiro to Iguazú"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:4b5ff9b4a37f43cc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "2adc2c0dd98014d92e5e24195a437a5605c22f223feabc52cfac7bcea80f6c26",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261110-work-8cfa443091a8",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to the airport and fly to Iguazú.\n\nOn arrival, spend half a day exploring the Brazilian side of the falls. The route follows the park's walkways and viewing platforms. The national park protects tropical vegetation and a rich variety of wildlife, and dense green forest surrounds the trail all the way to the cascades.\n\nAmong the best-known cascades are Floriano, Deodoro, Benjamin Constant and the Devil's Throat.\n\nAfter the tour, transfer to your hotel on the Argentine side. Breakfast is included."
    },
